      "updated_at": "2019-03-20T00:07:24Z",
      "body": "Hi @bersbersbers I can reproduce this issue on desktop Chrome on Windows and Edge if I shrink the browser window such that the TOPICS drop down appears. I think the issue is with that control not clearing the banner.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/12818376/54649911-559ec200-4a69-11e9-9f74-e54556ff47bc.png)\r\n\r\nA workaround is to use the triple bar control in the upper right, which navigates the top menu. After expanding the top menu list and selecting a section such as Docs or API, the banner disappears.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/12818376/54649943-75ce8100-4a69-11e9-8433-aa696611a873.png)\r\n",
